<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8" />
        <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
        <title>Área Restrita · RedBean Twig Slim</title>

        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, shrink-to-fit=no">

        <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
        <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
        <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,500;8..60,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ base_url() }}/assets/admin/plugins/fontawesome-free/css/all.min.css" />
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ base_url() }}/assets/admin/plugins/icheck-bootstrap/icheck-bootstrap.min.css" />
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ base_url() }}/assets/admin/css/theme.min.css" />
        <link href="{{ base_url() }}/assets/admin/css/custom.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    </head>
    <body class="portfolio-login">
        <main class="login-showcase">
            <section class="login-story">
                <a href="{{ base_url() }}" class="login-brand" title="Voltar para a vitrine">RedBean Twig Slim</a>
                <span class="login-eyebrow">Área restrita</span>
                <h1>Admin pronto para validar MVPs sem carregar um framework full-stack.</h1>
                <p>Login, dashboard, ACL por rota, CRUDs, perfil e upload de foto em uma base PHP pequena, direta e fácil de evoluir.</p>
                <div class="login-proof-grid">
                    <span>Slim 3</span>
                    <span>Twig 3</span>
                    <span>RedBeanPHP</span>
                    <span>ACL</span>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="login-card-panel">
                <div class="login-card-body" style="background-color: transparent">
                    <span class="login-eyebrow">Acesso administrativo</span>
                    <h2>Entrar no painel</h2>
                    <p class="login-card-lead">Use as credenciais iniciais após importar o seed local.</p>

                    <form id="FormUser" action="{{ base_url() }}/auth" class="form-horizontal" method="post" autocomplete="off">
                        {{ csrf_field() }}
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>Login ou e-mail</label>
                            <input type="text" name="login" class="form-control form-control-lg" placeholder="admin@admin" autocomplete="username" required>
                        </div>

                        <div id="show_hide_password" class="form-group">
                            <label>Senha</label>
                            <div class="input-group">
                                <input type="password" name="pass" class="form-control form-control-lg" placeholder="Digite sua senha" autocomplete="current-password" required>
                                <div class="input-group-append toggle-password">
                                    <div class="input-group-text">
                                        <a href=""><i class="fa fa-eye-slash"></i></a>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-lg btn-primary btn-block login-submit">Entrar</button>
                    </form>

                    <div class="login-seed-box">
                        <strong>Acesso inicial</strong>
                        <span>Login: <code>admin@admin</code></span>
                        <span>Senha: <code>123</code></span>
                    </div>

                    <p class="login-links"><a href="{{ base_url() }}/forgot-password">Esqueci minha senha</a></p>
                </div>
            </section>
        </main>

        <footer class="login-footer">
            Projeto autoral de Henrique Mariano · RedBeanPHP + Twig + SlimPHP 3
        </footer>

        <script src="{{ base_url() }}/assets/admin/plugins/jquery/jquery.min.js"></script>
        <script src="{{ base_url() }}/assets/admin/plugins/bootstrap/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
        <script src="{{ base_url() }}/assets/admin/js/theme.min.js"></script>
        <script src="{{ base_url() }}/assets/admin/js/login.js"></script>
        <script src="{{ base_url() }}/assets/js/lib/hideShowPassword.min.js"></script>
    </body>
</html>
